e='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>身份、工具描述、任务与结果</text><path d='M562 313 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='324' width='1140' height='96' rx='8' fill='#9FD0F5'/><text x='570.0' y='366.0' font-size='22' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>共用业务服务层</text><text x='570.0' y='392.0' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>教学规则、评分、数据与任务</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E2340', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>职责划分：宿主负责对话及通用办公能力，StudyAgent 负责教育数据、领域规则与可追溯业务结果；无需给每一个知识点或每一种步骤单独建立 MCP Server</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：系统Agent适配与MCP插件接入设计.md §1</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 87 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>